      <Output>
        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>OPEN: the car comes in sight 3 s into the pass and the CAV abandons it while still beside the car it was passing: it merges back at that car's tail, closing at 13 m/s, and touches it (42.6 s). The rule 'finish or go back' must brake first to make the gap before merging.</Message>
        </ErrorInfo>
